 @sayori1989 not gonna lie, I wouldn’t put a 5060 in a full size rig just because there are better options but for an SFF build it’s pretty great. If this thing had 12GB of RAM it’d be my favorite card of the generation. 

For 1080p console gaming with low temps and low-ish power draw, I’m loving it. 

Just got a custom printed 3.4L case that I’m going to squeeze it into. Smaller than a PS5 or Xbox and way more fun.

 @budgetgamingtechdad  5 fps to 7-10 fps is a 40-100% difference.
Please stop using solid numbers out of context.
PCIE version and lanes becomes important first when VRAM is exceeded.
